     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "month",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與結識畢蘇斯基",
      "en": "Origins and meeting Piłsudski"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "索斯恩科夫斯基1885年11月19日生於華沙。1908年2月，他在利沃夫的波蘭社會黨（PPS）會議上結識畢蘇斯基，此後兩人成為合作者與朋友。",
      "en": "He was born in Warsaw on 19 November 1885. In February 1908, at a Polish Socialist Party meeting in Lwów, he met Józef Piłsudski, and from then on the two became collaborators and friends."
     },
     "relatedRecordIds": [],
     "citations": [
      {
       "sourceKey": "pilsudski-biogram",
       "locator": "biogram, para 1",
       "quote": "He was born in Warsaw on November 19, 1885.",
