      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "ord": 2,
     "period": {
      "start": "1918-11-16",
      "end": "1940-01-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "建軍與戰間期軍政職務",
      "en": "Army-building and interwar posts"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1918年11月16日他出任華沙軍區司令，1919年3月3日起任第二副軍事部長，1920年8月10日至1924年2月19日任軍事部長。1925至1927年任第七軍區司令，1927至1939年任軍團監察長。",
      "en": "On 16 November 1918 he became commander of the Warsaw Military District; from 3 March 1919 he was second deputy minister of military affairs, and from 10 August 1920 to 19 February 1924 minister of military affairs. In 1925–1927 he commanded Corps District VII, and in 1927–1939 he was Inspector of Armies."
     },
