    {
     "ord": 3,
     "period": {
      "start": "1939-09-10",
      "end": "1939-11-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "month",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "1939年南方戰線",
      "en": "Southern Front, 1939"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1939年戰役中，他擔任南方戰線司令；畢蘇斯基研究所稱任命在9月10日，他當時指揮的是尚未成形的南方戰線。他未能突入被圍的利沃夫，IPN稱利沃夫守軍未等到由他率領的南方戰線部隊解圍。他於同年10月已在法國。",
      "en": "In the 1939 campaign he was commander of the Southern Front; the Piłsudski Institute dates the appointment to 10 September, when the front was yet to be formed. He could not break into besieged Lwów, and the IPN says Lwów's defenders did not receive the relief led by the southern-front forces under him. By October of that year he was in France."
     },
