    {
     "ord": 4,
     "period": {
      "start": "1939-11-01",
      "end": "1944-12-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "month",
     "periodEndPrecision": "month",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "流亡政府與總司令",
      "en": "Exile government and Commander-in-Chief"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1939年11月他進入西科爾斯基的流亡政府。西科爾斯基死後，他於1943年7月8日接任總司令，任職至1944年9月30日，之後被總統拉奇凱維奇解除職務。1944年11月他前往加拿大。",
      "en": "In November 1939 he entered General Sikorski's government in exile. After Sikorski's death he took over as Commander-in-Chief on 8 July 1943, serving until 30 September 1944, when President Raczkiewicz dismissed him. In November 1944 he left for Canada."
     },
